## HTML Mastery Roadmap{.text-center}

This roadmap is designed to take you from **complete beginner to advanced HTML**, while keeping the chapters in a logical learning order. It focuses on HTML itself first, then moves into accessibility, semantics, forms, SEO, browser behavior, performance, and modern HTML.
:::

:::.col-12 .col-lg-4
![img](https://kvadrat.az/uploads/articles/666205d642ae1.jpg)
:::
:::

**Total Curriculum**

* **40 chapters**
* **Beginner:** Chapters 1–12
* **Intermediate:** Chapters 13–25
* **Advanced:** Chapters 26–39
* **Mastery:** Chapter 40 + real projects
* Covers HTML syntax, elements, attributes, semantics, forms, media, SVG, Canvas, accessibility, SEO, security, performance, Web Components, browser internals, and production architecture.

